flowchart LR
  U[Developer / researcher] -->|HTTP| UI[Benchmark Web UI / Controller]
  UI -->|spawn fresh JVM per repetition| R[Java Benchmark Runner]
  R --> LG[Action Generator]
  LG --> SUT{Runtime adapter}
  SUT --> MF[Multiplayer Framework]
  SUT --> S1[S1 executor/session]
  SUT --> S2[S2 shared pool + serial queue]
  SUT --> PK[Apache Pekko actors]
  MF --> M[Metrics recorder]
  S1 --> M
  S2 --> M
  PK --> M
  M --> RAW[(samples.csv + summary.json)]
  UI --> MAN[(manifest.json + status.json)]
  RAW --> AN[analysis.py]
  MAN --> AN
  AN --> REP[(analysis.json + analysis.csv)]
  RAW --> HASH[SHA-256 checksums]
  MAN --> HASH
  REP --> HASH
